    "responsibilities": [
      "Category: Technical | Phases required: Deployment (Y), Operation (N) | Position type: Contracted/temporary.",
      "Developer / programmer: design and develop software programs that meet business requirements; deploy across test, staging, and production environments; troubleshoot and fix bugs; collaborate with QA and training teams.",
      "Integration specialist: design integration solutions to use interoperability features across multiple systems; develop integration standards and protocols; coordinate with architects and programmers to develop and maintain application integrations."
